{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-_NqtOBxQMJaDFqanl25kw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:50.268718+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-_NqtOBxQMJaDFqanl25kw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>点击蓝字</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/EvicmuLUA5qtlY3GV3s4r0QIsfeHuUH2eicLhwp1nEWmbIH7HPNiclKibcbZEW2ceJlXBds5lWdnzdeXap9P0VZlaLHT6iaHibBl6f2zfVpzDb8YU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> 关注我们</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/EvicmuLUA5quyKE6xiaCb8ic59r1iaYBCmxm0sNkxnou4frz2meXPgyWFVcEhlCq4twLVhp9HvicqleYVCRiap60X0GzIIVkRHAUwFJpHbPo1uaco/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span>上海创芯学院</span></strong></span><span><span>（Shanghai Institute of Semiconductor Innovation, SISI）（以下简称“创芯学院”）是一所服务集成电路设计国家战略需求，</span><strong><span>面向技术创新、面向产业发展、面向企业需求</span></strong><span>，创新人才培养模式，汇聚高校、企业、产线资源的新型研发机构，立足于打造中国集成电路设计人才的“黄埔军校”。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>创芯学院由复旦大学、上海交通大学和上海科技大学共同参与创建，通过整合资源、发挥各校优势，为工程硕博研究生的培养构建具有创新活力的产教融合育人平台。创芯学院现已从三所共建高校聘任100多位高水平产教融合导师，并完成两批工程硕博招生共计超300人，产教融合育人体系全面落地。学生学籍分属三所共建高校，完成全部培养任务并通过审核后，获颁创芯学院结业证书、学籍所在高校的毕业证书和学位证书。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>本次招生由创芯学院与上海科技大学联合开展，毕业授予上海科技大学电子信息（0854）专业学位，依托创芯学院产业融合的创新培养体系与高校优质学术资源，为学子搭建从理论研究到工程落地的全链条培养通道，助力成长为契合产业核心需求的复合型芯片设计人才。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/EvicmuLUA5quX5icbMaTdYsrjkYkgrf4bVcbLwzt19qWGQXRntOicYl2RlUTBIou5ExOjN30Bpo8yticic9kYEGI9Ht1vNcG7dSIaxDznTdI7dtw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><font><span><span>一、</span></span></font></strong></span><span><strong><span>创芯学院核心培养特色</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span><span>（一）创新培养模式</span></span></strong></p><p><span>创芯学院创新构建学术导师 + 产业导师 + 战略导师三位一体指导模式，学术导师保障理论研究深度，产业导师确保工程落地质量，战略导师精准把控研究方向前瞻性，实现理论、实践、战略的全方位培养。</span></p><p><span>创芯学院将作为国家创新体系中的关键接口，承担起体制机制探索、高端人才集聚与领军人才培育的三重使命。创芯学院将集中力量培养具备设计实战能力的专精领域人才，以及从应用算法定义到硅片实现的全流程全栈能力的领军人才。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（二）学制设置（全日制）</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.电子信息专业型硕士：基本学制为2年，最长修业年限为3年。</span></p><p><span>2.电子信息专业型博士：基本学制为4年，最长修业年限为6年。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><font><span><span>二、</span></span></font></strong></span><span><span><strong><span> 申请条件</span></strong></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1. 推免生：在其本科学校拟获得推免资格的应届本科毕业生（2027年毕业）。</span></p><p><span>2. 本科所学专业为集成电路设计与集成系统、集成电路科学与工程、微电子科学与工程、电子信息工程、人工智能、计算机科学与技术、软件工程、智能科学与技术、光电信息科学与工程等理工类专业。</span></p><p><span>3. 学习成绩优秀，英语水平良好，对信息学科的科研与创新有浓厚兴趣。</span></p><p><span>4. 诚实守信，学风端正，无学术不端记录。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><font><span><span>三、</span></span></font></strong></span><span><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>登录上海科技大学研究生招生报名评分系统：</span></p><p><span>https://gadmission.shanghaitech.edu.cn/enroll_student/完成信息填报。</span></p><p><span>特别说明：</span></p><p><span>1） 完成账号注册，登录后请选择进入“上海创芯学院”，选择具体的报名入口：“2027研招 | 上海创芯学院&amp;上海科技大学联培推免面试”</span></p><p><span>2） 填报专业请选择：电子信息（0854）专业学位（含直博），无需选报导师，具体招生导师以实际发布为准。</span></p><p><span>3）报名过程中务必注意信息保存，提交前请仔细检查，提交后则无法修改。</span></p><p><span>报名截止时间：2026年8月23日 (含)。报名时间根据实际报名情况可能适当顺延，具体以报名系统为准。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/EvicmuLUA5qvQRnAabzG3orDDib7s0MMTLP1nzqBctN5EicjZPRE0WOHXlkNVoDnFYA1NWChCbANd7JrCKK36GvErbic7LofmIzbYwTaibbrHTFM/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><font><span><span>四、</span></span></font></strong></span><span><strong><span>报名材料</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>请准备如下材料的彩色扫描件，并按照下述顺序将所有材料合并为一个 PDF 文件，文件命名为：姓名-身份证后四位-申请材料，提交至上述报名链接。</span></p><p><span>A：必须提供的材料</span></p><p><span>1. 有效身份证件正反面；</span></p><p><span>2. 学生证 (照片、学号页即可)；</span></p><p><span>3. 英文个人陈述+中文个人陈述（个人陈述侧重描述自己的科研能力和潜力，以及研究生阶段的科研及学习计划，字数不限）；</span></p><p><span>4. 英文简历+中文简历；</span></p><p><span>5. 本科成绩单 (院系或教务处盖章，可提供学校网络截图)；</span></p><p><span>6. 英语水平证明材料 (四六级证书等)。</span></p><p><span>B：自愿提供的材料（此项不做强制要求，考生可根据自身情况酌情选择是否提供）</span></p><p><span>1. 获奖证书扫描件；</span></p><p><span>2. 其他能证明自身潜力的材料 (如已发表的论文、专利或其他原创性工作成果)。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><font><span><span>五、</span></span></font></strong></span><span><span><strong><span> 复试流程</span></strong></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1. 预计8月底起开始邮件通知获得复试资格的同学以及分批复试时间，进入复试者将收到邮件通知，请留意报名阶段预留的邮箱。</span></p><p><span>2. 复试形式：线上综合素质考核、线下专业面试。</span></p><p><span>3. 复试通过者，发拟接收函，将通过邮件向考生本人发布（拟录取考生可提前主动与双聘导师开展沟通，双聘导师信息详见附件链接）。</span></p><p><span>4. 教育部网上报名：复试通过并且取得学校外推免试资格的同学，请于9月中下旬开始按教育部网上报名要求进行报名。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><font><span><span>六、</span></span></font></strong></span><span><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1. 申请人必须保证全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。如果申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，将取消申请人免试资格。全部申请材料一经收到，概不退还。</span></p><p><span>2. 获得我院推免生接收资格，且完成教育部网上推免填报的同学，不得再联系出国、就业及其他招生单位。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/EvicmuLUA5qugGQFDHaAjMwnibqhU1ZVQZUPbVzICNqkwnBeZRMw6CWWw9YVzTm4TmjX6Tva0VJYaVfGmqo6PkqObvpIaFOrtQA2xObb2m5B4/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><font><span><span>七、</span></span></font></strong></span><span><strong><span>其他</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>本通知如有与国家新出台的招生政策或上海市相关文件不符的事项，以上级单位新政策或文件要求为准。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><font><span><span>八、</span></span></font></strong></span><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>咨询电话：021-20684563 </span></p><p><span>咨询邮箱：admission@sisi.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><font><span><span>附件：</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>2027年上海创芯学院&amp;上海科技大学推免招生导师信息表：</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DZWJSY3RURWptSkhG</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/EvicmuLUA5quofoZhiap9b2Uplg5YztB05grbicenRxG1qQba1FpsjS0DODqDP63icNQ7SGLyMDsj8ISSic2Ff6kHjCuW4LL8qNasS859k4BAKibQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>欢迎关注</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>欢迎关注上海创芯学院微信公众号“上海创芯学院”，公众号会及时推送招生、导师课题组、研究领域介绍等相关信息。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/EvicmuLUA5qvJvHSpTbwGBOh2STXHUDQwfnIWl3ptw7FMbaiap3AKnjIKtFnJ4Qtgbe52egdYZict2vIw31LUW4dyZNAcZ5iaemc4g70YCiaDDhM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"7d4c60478ace75fba0c7e7395ca7c1d34a086df2a705ba6f831dda53f6a3486a","textLength":2108,"sourceSha256":"52f202d2333e7